---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="uses" desc="hardware, software, and tools i use">
  <section>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">uses</h1>
    <div class="mt-5 flex items-start gap-2 text-text-muted italic">
      <span class="shrink-0 text-theme-link">&gt;</span>
      <p>hardware, software, and tools i use</p>
    </div> 
    <div class="prose mt-8 [&_li]:leading-6">
      <h2>hardware</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>machine:</strong> macbook air m1 8/256gb</li>
        <li><strong>mouse:</strong> arctic fox pureview</li>
        <li><strong>phone:</strong> galaxy a50</li>
        <li><strong>earphone:</strong> oneplus nord buds 2r</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>software</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>os:</strong> macos | arch linux | mint</li>
        <li><strong>browser:</strong> chrome | firefox</li>
        <li><strong>file manager:</strong> yazi</li>
        <li><strong>music:</strong> spotify</li>
        <li><strong>media:</strong> stremio</li>
        <li><strong>messaging:</strong> discord | telegram</li>
        <li><strong>notes:</strong> obsidian</li>
        <li><strong>vpn:</strong> protonvpn</li>
        <li><strong>archiver:</strong> 7-zip</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>coding</h2>
      <p>i mostly use neovim and zed; check out my <a href="https://github.com/3p5ilon/dotfiles">dotfiles</a>.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>editor:</strong> neovim | zed</li>
        <li><strong>terminal:</strong> ghostty | kitty</li>
        <li><strong>shell:</strong> zsh</li>
        <li><strong>tools:</strong> tmux | fzf | lazygit | btop | fastfetch | stow</li>
        <li><strong>replacements:</strong> zoxide | ripgrep | fd | bat | eza | tldr</li>
        <li><strong>font:</strong> jetbrains mono nerd font</li>
        <li><strong>theme:</strong> catppuccin | tokyonight</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>browser</h2>
      <p>i use chrome as my primary browser and firefox as my secondary.</p>
      <h3 class="mt-0">extensions</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>vimium</li>
        <li>dark reader</li>
        <li>ublock origin</li>
        <li>json viewer pro</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
